
# JARVIS CORE

Advanced Personal AI Assistant

## Vision
Build a futuristic personal AI assistant inspired by JARVIS from Iron Man.

## Core Features
- Natural Egyptian Arabic voice conversations.
- Advanced AI reasoning and persistent memory.
- Futuristic holographic user interface.
- Android phone control.
- WhatsApp and Gmail integration.
- Smart notifications and proactive assistance.
- Voice calls and reminders.
- Camera vision and hand gesture recognition.

## Development Principles
- Modular and scalable architecture.
- Secure permissions and API credentials.
- Test every feature before integration.
- Preserve stable versions.
- No unnecessary code replacement.

## Development Roadmap
1. Project foundation.
2. Futuristic interface.
3. Real-time voice engine.
4. AI personality and memory.
5. Android system integration.
6. Messaging and notifications.
7. Camera and computer vision.
